<title>HONG KONG: Realty Dev interim profit up 2.1 percent.</title>
<headline>Realty Dev interim profit up 2.1 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Earnings per A Shr (H.K. cents) 196   vs 192</p>
<p>    Earnings per B Shr (H.K. cents) 39    vs 38</p>
<p>    Dividend A shr (H.K. cents)     31.5  vs 31.5</p>
<p>    Dividend B shr (H.K. cents)     6.3   vs 6.3</p>
<p>    Exceptional items		   nil   vs 233.9 gain</p>
<p>    Net				     452.2 vs 443.1</p>
<p>    Turnover				801.1 vs 715.2</p>
<p>    Company name			  Realty Development Corp Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close			   January 13-16, 1997</p>
<p>    Dividend payable		    January 21</p>
<p>NOTE - Realty Development is a property firm that also operates business clubs.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
